        "original_id": "96345f15-9d2e-58b4-a190-6d4d0e47ca16",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andy Borowitz, Joseph Marcell, Will Smith, Mena Massoud, Naomi Scott, Marwan Kenzari, Navid Negahban, Nasim Pedrad, Billy Magnussen, Numan Acar\n- Products: The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air, The Borowitz Report, Aladdin (2019 film)\n- Organizations: NBC\n- Roles: Geoffrey the butler\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Marcell was born on 18 August 1948 and is a Saint Lucian born British actor.\n- Andy Borowitz was born on January 4, 1958 and is an American writer, comedian, satirist, and actor.\n- The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air originally aired on NBC from September 10, 1990, to May 20, 1996.\n- The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air stars Will Smith as a fictionalized version of himself, a street-smart teenager from West Philadelphia who moves to his wealthy aunt and uncle's Bel Air mansion after a fight on a local basketball court.\n- Joseph Marcell is best known for playing Geoffrey the butler on the NBC sitcom The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air from September 1990 until May 1996.\n- Andy Borowitz is known for creating The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air and the satirical column The Borowitz Report.\n- Aladdin (2019 film) stars Mena Massoud in the title role, with Naomi Scott, Will Smith, Marwan Kenzari, Navid Negahban, Nasim Pedrad, Billy Magnussen, and Numan Acar in supporting roles.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
